      "text": "The /agent command decomposes tasks into child momo subagent processes run in parallel with a synthesizer merging results, bounded by env rails MOMO_RLM_MAX_DEPTH (3), MOMO_RLM_BUDGET (8), and MOMO_RLM_TIMEOUT_MS (300000)."
